                // is sent on its behalf elsewhere and never passes through this
                // writer, and a caller left awaiting would hold its run open for
                // good -- the very wedge patch 4 exists to prevent.
                setTimeout(done, KIT_WAIT_CEILING_MAX_MS + 60000).unref?.();
